 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Start': Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die (posted 'Court of TVG..... I Shalle enjoy WYD'), Prepared Defenses, Mobilization Points, No Bargain, Power Of The Hutt, Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon, Jabba's Palace: Dungeon, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber; these count toward the 60. Several Effects start, none named as the starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "The list as published totals 61 cards.",
  "Posted 'tatooine' under Effect dested Tatooine Occupation (the strategy says 'tatooine occupation adds insult to injury when u get tatooine out'); 'Tatooine' under Locations dested the Premiere Dark Tatooine system.",
  "Posted 'Tat Dock Bay' dested Tatooine: Docking Bay 94 (Dark), the only Dark Tatooine docking bay printed before the Tatooine expansion.",
  "Posted 'Dr. Ev and Ponda' dested Dr. Evazan & Ponda Baba; 'Fett in boat' Boba Fett In Slave I (alongside 'Dengar in boat', 'Zuckuss in boat', 'Bossk in boat'); 'Fett w/ Gun' Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'IG88 w/ gun' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Dengar w/ Gun' Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Mara's Saber' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Vibro Ax' the Dark Vibro-Ax.",
  "Posted 'Big Blue Poo' (in the starship/vehicle section) matches no card; 'Big Blue' is period slang for Star Destroyers, but no ship is named, so it is printed as written."
